## API reference

### RadioGroup

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `name:` | `String` | the Field's, or generated | Shared by the radios. |
| `default_value:` / `value:` | `String` | - | The checked option. |
| `orientation:` | `:vertical`, `:horizontal` | `:vertical` | A column or a row. |
| `disabled:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Disables every option. |
| `required:` | `Boolean` | `false` | An option must be picked before the form submits. |
| `invalid:` | `Boolean` | - | Error state; a Field sets it. |

### Radio

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `value:` | `String` | - | **Required.** What this option submits. |

Other attributes (`disabled:`, `aria_*`) go to the `<input>`; `class:` to the circle.

## Accessibility

- The group is a `role="radiogroup"`: name it with `aria_label:` / `aria_labelledby:` (a Field does it for you).
- Arrow keys move the selection within the group; a disabled option is skipped.
- The dot's pop-in is skipped under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
